# AutoMC's default local model (Block 5 decision D7): qwen3.6 35B-A3B with a 128k context and temperature 0. 128k is the minimum
# context for any local model AutoMC is designed for. Same parameters as the Control Room Agent's recipe of 2026-10-21.
#
# Build it once, in the Ollama that AutoMC talks to (the WSL one by default), from AutoMC/src:
#   ollama create qwen3.6:35b-128k-t0 -f config/ollama/qwen3.6-35b-128k-t0.Modelfile
#
# FROM must name the base model as that Ollama has it ('ollama list'): qwen3.6:35b-a3b in the WSL Ollama, qwen3.6:35b in the
# Windows one. A new machine: ollama pull qwen3.6:35b-a3b.
#
# Memory: the model is hybrid (full attention in 1 of 4 blocks, 2 KV heads of 256), so the KV cache grows by about 20 KB per token:
# about 2.7 GB at 128k. The model and cache need about 27 GB.
FROM qwen3.6:35b-a3b

PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1
